        "The competitive landscape of the web scraping services market is fragmented, with no single company dominating. The CMI report names Phantombuster, PilotFish, Mozenda, Diggernaut, Datahut and UiPath among the players, and the full list runs longer still, taking in Kuaiyi Technology, SysNucleus, Parseur, Octopus Data and Salestools.io. The field stretches from automation platforms to data-extraction tools, so buyers meet a wide range of companies that offer web scraping services. That spread gives buyers plenty of choice, and it keeps any one vendor from setting the terms for everyone."
