- [fs.drivers.1] Growing adoption of robo-advisory services and virtual financial assistance solutions lets end users manage their wealth more efficiently and drives revenue growth. (CMI report)
- [fs.drivers.2] Increasing competition among wealth management firms fuels demand for versatile wealth management platforms. (CMI report)
- [fs.drivers.3] Changing needs and expectations of younger client segments push wealth advisory firms to adopt comprehensive platforms. (CMI report)
