          "paragraph": "Marketing automation software carries the heaviest weight in the Digital Marketing Software Market because it does the work most companies notice first. The software sends the emails, schedules the posts and moves a customer from one message to the next without a person stepping in. Artificial intelligence has made these tools sharper at choosing what each customer sees. Salesforce made AI agents touchpoints in the customer journey as part of its Agentforce launch, tying them into its revenue engine and attribution models, Forrester reported in October 2026. Forrester notes that Salesforce's website produces 200 signals that feed attribution models and decide the next best experience for a visitor. That move shows where the sub-segment is heading: automation that decides as well as delivers."
