QUESTION 2 (Q4): What is driving the growth of the digital marketing software market?
Facts this answer may use:
- The integration of AI and machine learning in marketing solutions enhances personalization and campaign effectiveness, with AI users achieving up to 30% higher conversion rates in 2026.
- Rising global digital advertising expenditure fuels adoption, with Asia Pacific digital ad spends growing 19% annually between 2024 and 2026.
