- W18 [suits: key_players, trends] Salesforce has outlined a fiscal 2030 framework targeting a "Rule of 50," combining revenue growth and margin performance, with sales and marketing efficiency cited as a potential margin lever. (source: MarketBeat · via Yahoo Finance, 2026-08)
