- The retained text is a BARE LINKED PHRASE, not a paragraph: "Customer data management systems". Write intro paragraph 2 as a paragraph of your own in which the placeholder [[SPONSOR_PARAGRAPH]] appears exactly ONCE, INSIDE one of your sentences, as a noun phrase that sentence grammatically needs, with your own words before it and your own words after it in that same paragraph (illustrative shape only, not real content: "...and that review starts with [[SPONSOR_PARAGRAPH]] a team already runs, because ..."). The phrase is inserted exactly as written, including its capitalisation, so choose a sentence shape in which it reads naturally. Never repeat or paraphrase the phrase yourself anywhere else in the article.
